{"title":"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A circle with radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is contained within the region bounded by a circle with radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. The area bounded by the larger circle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/4/084079bf1d54500f3c59257a7ec3467932b72ba2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"34\" /> times the area of the region outside the smaller circle and inside the larger circle. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/1/c211615ac616c51aeef870f11e55fec95e3a149c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R:r$\" width=\"37\" height=\"12\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/e/16e9d45cd37f97cbe417072b6dc543c41104c52a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) }\\sqrt{a}:\\sqrt{b} \\quad \\text{(B) } \\sqrt{a}:\\sqrt{a-b}\\quad \\text{(C) } \\sqrt{b}:\\sqrt{a-b}\\quad \\text{(D) } a:\\sqrt{a-b}\\quad \\text{(E) } b:\\sqrt{a-b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"627\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The area of the larger circle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/d/dfd2c52d64dc5baec4f7840d285670f6aeb560fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi R^2$\" width=\"31\" height=\"15\" />, and the area of the region outside the smaller circle and inside the larger circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/7/62745ae8437bb0c4e09d71cfe98124c42d0b1626.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi R^2 - \\pi r^2$\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" />.  Thus,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/a/efaac7260f3a6808f73aca7a1948856dfb83f2fd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\pi R^2 = \\frac{a}{b} \\cdot (\\pi R^2 - \\pi r^2)\\]\" width=\"177\" height=\"32\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/0/df0441a5e6ccedf6685d8c2e7bc3cdce575b0f8b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[R^2 = \\frac{a}{b} \\cdot R^2 - \\frac{a}{b} \\cdot r^2\\]\" width=\"157\" height=\"32\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/3/2539908e0ac0fb933b503410eb57bf0ed489ca15.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a}{b} \\cdot r^2 = (\\frac{a}{b} -1)R^2\\]\" width=\"144\" height=\"32\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/0/ab0b5cfa7c06ee1bb9ef0aef92ee4ba8c25e5abd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a}{b} \\div \\frac{a-b}{b} = \\frac{R^2}{r^2}\\]\" width=\"125\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/f/63f0ebeda5e59189b9e6e0727eccbf0405cd650b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a}{a-b} = \\frac{R^2}{r^2}\\]\" width=\"89\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/6/f96cef1d66155c62e30c9b6ac97f8102037fc687.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{a-b}} = \\frac{R}{r}\\]\" width=\"97\" height=\"43\" />\nThe answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME\" title=\"1969 AHSME\">1969 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1969 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1969\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1969 AHSME 